---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="我的关注 — MaaS Daily" description="关注你使用的模型，查看变化并订阅每日邮件摘要。" noindex={true}>
  <div class="account-page" data-account-page>
    <header class="account-heading"><p class="eyebrow">MY WATCHLIST</p><h1>只关注与你有关的变化。</h1><p>保存你使用的模型，集中查看价格与动态。开启邮件提醒后，有变化才发摘要。</p></header>
    <p id="account-message" role="status" aria-live="polite">正在连接账号服务…</p>
    <section id="login-panel" class="login-layout" hidden>
      <div><h2>用邮箱开始</h2><p>首次登录会自动创建个人空间。<br />邮箱用于登录和你主动开启的变化提醒。</p><p class="small">无需设置密码，验证码 10 分钟内有效。</p></div>
      <form id="login-form">
        <label for="email">邮箱</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required placeholder="you@company.com" />
        <button id="send-code" type="button">发送验证码</button>
        <div id="code-fields" hidden><label for="code">六位验证码</label><input id="code" name="code" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" pattern="[0-9]{6}" maxlength="6" /><button type="submit">登录 / 创建账号</button></div>
      </form>
    </section>
    <section id="workspace" hidden>
      <div class="workspace-bar"><span><b id="user-email"></b><small>个人空间 · 免费版</small></span><button id="logout" class="quiet">退出登录</button></div>
      <div class="watch-layout">
        <section class="watch-main">
          <div class="section-title"><h2>我的模型 <span id="watch-count">0</span></h2><span class="small">最多 50 个</span></div>
          <div id="watch-list"></div>
        </section>
        <section class="changes-main">
          <h2 class="changes-title">关注模型的近期变化</h2><p id="changes-asof" class="small"></p><div id="watch-changes"></div>
        </section>
        <aside>
          <section class="search-panel"><h2>添加关注</h2><label for="model-search">搜索模型或系列</label><input id="model-search" type="search" placeholder="例如 DeepSeek、GPT" autocomplete="off" /><p id="search-note" class="small"></p><div id="model-results"></div></section>
          <section class="preference-panel"><h2>每日邮件摘要</h2><label class="check-label"><input id="email-enabled" type="checkbox" /><span>有变化时发送到我的邮箱</span></label><p>默认关闭。开启后，只发送后续观察到的变化，不补发历史。邮件里可随时退订。</p></section>
          <p class="coverage-note">仅匹配已明确关联模型的记录。平台级动态可能没有模型归属；没有提醒不代表供应商没有变化。<a href="/changes">查看全部平台变化 →</a></p>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>
    <noscript><p>登录和关注需要 JavaScript；你仍可访问<a href="/pricing/">价格页</a>和<a href="/changes">全部变化</a>。</p></noscript>
  </div>
</Layout>
<script>
  import '../../scripts/account';
</script>
<style>
  .account-page{padding:48px 0 72px;max-width:1120px;margin:auto}.account-heading{max-width:760px;margin-bottom:32px}.eyebrow{font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.15em;color:var(--muted)}h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.2rem);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:12px 0 20px;text-wrap:balance}.account-heading>p:last-child{color:var(--paper-soft);line-height:1.8}h2{font-size:1.12rem;margin:0 0 16px}p{line-height:1.75}#account-message{min-height:28px;color:var(--paper-soft);margin-bottom:24px}#account-message[data-error="true"]{color:var(--red)}.login-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:64px;padding:36px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.login-layout p{color:var(--muted)}form{max-width:380px}label{display:block;font-size:.88rem;margin-bottom:8px}input[type="email"],input[type="text"],input[type="search"],input[inputmode="numeric"]{display:block;width:100%;padding:13px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:6px;background:var(--panel-solid);color:var(--paper);font:inherit;margin-bottom:16px}:global(.account-page button){border:0;border-radius:5px;padding:11px 16px;background:var(--acid);color:var(--ink);font:inherit;cursor:pointer;transition:opacity .18s,transform .18s}:global(.account-page button:hover){opacity:.85}:global(.account-page button:active){transform:translateY(1px)}:global(.account-page button:disabled){opacity:.5;cursor:wait}:global(.account-page .quiet){background:transparent;color:var(--paper-soft);border:1px solid var(--line-strong)}input:focus-visible,:global(.account-page button:focus-visible){outline:2px solid var(--acid);outline-offset:3px}#code-fields{margin-top:24px}.small,small{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}.workspace-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:20px 0;margin-bottom:32px}.workspace-bar b{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.workspace-bar small{display:block;margin-top:6px}.watch-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 320px;gap:32px 48px;grid-template-rows:auto 1fr}.watch-layout aside{grid-column:2;grid-row:1 / span 2}.section-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline}.section-title h2 span{margin-left:8px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--muted)}.search-panel,.preference-panel{padding:24px;background:var(--ink-2);border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:20px}.check-label{display:flex;align-items:start;gap:10px;line-height:1.6}.check-label input{margin-top:5px;accent-color:var(--acid)}.preference-panel p,.coverage-note{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted)}.coverage-note a{display:block;margin-top:12px}.changes-title{margin-top:0}[hidden]{display:none!important}@media(max-width:760px){.account-page{padding-top:32px}.login-layout,.watch-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}.watch-layout aside{grid-column:1;grid-row:2}.changes-main{grid-row:3}.workspace-bar{gap:16px}.search-panel,.preference-panel{padding:20px}}
</style>
<style is:global>
  .watch-row,.model-result{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:15px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.watch-row a,.model-result span{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.model-result button{padding:7px 11px;font-size:.8rem;flex-shrink:0}.watch-empty{padding:28px 0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8}.watch-change{padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.watch-change a{font-weight:600}.watch-change p{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--paper-soft);margin:10px 0}.watch-change small{color:var(--muted)}
</style>
